values ($lx$albert-hsia-do-chandler$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Albert Hsia, DO (Banner Health)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking family medicine doctor at Banner Health Center in Chandler, seeing children, teens, adults and seniors.$lx$, $lx$錢德勒 Banner Health Center 會說國語的家庭醫學科醫師，看診對象包括兒童、青少年、成人及長者。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Albert Hsia is a family medicine physician (DO) at Banner Health Center, 1435 S Alma School Rd, in Chandler, and also sees patients at Banner Health Center on E Irma Lane in Phoenix. Dr. Hsia cares for children, teenagers, adults and seniors. Dr. Hsia earned a medical degree at Midwestern University in Glendale in 2016 and completed a family medicine residency at HonorHealth Four Peaks Medical Center in 2019. Dr. Hsia speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed in Banner Health's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Albert Hsia 醫師是家庭醫學科醫師（DO），在錢德勒（Chandler）1435 S Alma School Rd 的 Banner Health Center 看診，也在鳳凰城 E Irma Lane 的 Banner Health Center 看診。看診對象涵蓋兒童、青少年、成人及長者。Hsia 醫師於 2016 年畢業於格倫代爾的 Midwestern University 醫學院，2019 年在 HonorHealth Four Peaks Medical Center 完成家庭醫學科住院醫師訓練。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據 Banner Health「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Chandler$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1435 S Alma School Rd, Chandler, AZ 85286$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 668-1600$lx$, null, $lx$https://doctors.bannerhealth.com/provider/albert-hsia/2297991$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Albert Hsia, DO (Banner Health)$lx$, $lx$Chandler$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$doctors.bannerhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

