values ($lx$alan-wang-md-phoenix$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Alan Wang, MD (Banner Health)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking epilepsy and neurology specialist at the Banner - University Medicine Neurosciences Clinic in Phoenix.$lx$, $lx$鳳凰城 Banner - University Medicine 神經科學診所會說國語的癲癇及神經內科醫師。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Alan Wang is a neurologist specializing in epilepsy at the Banner - University Medicine Neurosciences Clinic, 755 E McDowell Rd, Floor 3, in Phoenix, and sees adult patients. Dr. Wang earned a medical degree at the University of Arizona, completed an internship and residency at Thomas Jefferson University Hospital and a fellowship at the University of Miami / Jackson Health System, and is board certified in neurology by the American Board of Psychiatry and Neurology. Dr. Wang speaks English and Mandarin. Appointments are booked through the Banner Health profile. Languages as listed in Banner Health's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Alan Wang 醫師是神經內科醫師，專長癲癇，在鳳凰城 755 E McDowell Rd 三樓的 Banner - University Medicine Neurosciences Clinic 看診，對象為成人病患。Wang 醫師畢業於亞利桑那大學醫學院，在 Thomas Jefferson University Hospital 完成實習及住院醫師訓練，並在 University of Miami / Jackson Health System 完成專科研修，持有美國精神醫學及神經醫學委員會（ABPN）神經科專科認證。能說英語及國語。可透過 Banner Health 醫師頁面預約。語言資訊依據 Banner Health「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$755 E McDowell Rd, Floor 3, Phoenix, AZ 85006$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://doctors.bannerhealth.com/provider/alan-wang/776227$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Alan Wang, MD (Banner Health)$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$doctors.bannerhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
