values ($lx$mimi-chao-md-mesa$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Mimi Chao, MD (Banner Children's)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking pediatric plastic and craniofacial surgeon at Banner Children's Specialists in Mesa, accepting new patients.$lx$, $lx$梅薩 Banner Children's Specialists 會說國語的兒童整形及顱顏外科醫師，目前接受新病患。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Mimi Chao is a pediatric plastic and craniofacial surgeon at Banner Children's Specialists Plastic and Craniofacial Surgery Clinic, 1432 S Dobson Rd, Suite 301, in Mesa. Dr. Chao treats children and is accepting new patients. The Banner profile lists medical training at the University of Iowa, residency at Saint Louis University and a fellowship at UPMC Children's Hospital of Pittsburgh, and Dr. Chao is board certified by the American Board of Plastic Surgery. Dr. Chao speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed in Banner Health's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Mimi Chao 醫師是兒童整形及顱顏外科醫師，在梅薩（Mesa）1432 S Dobson Rd, Suite 301 的 Banner Children's Specialists 整形及顱顏外科診所看診。看診對象為兒童，目前接受新病患。Banner 醫師頁面列出 Chao 醫師在愛荷華大學接受醫學訓練、在聖路易大學完成住院醫師訓練，並在匹茲堡大學醫學中心兒童醫院（UPMC）完成專科研修，持有美國整形外科醫學委員會專科認證。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據 Banner Health「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1432 S Dobson Rd, Suite 301, Mesa, AZ 85202$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 412-7120$lx$, null, $lx$https://doctors.bannerhealth.com/provider/mimi-chao/3213249$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Mimi Chao, MD (Banner Children's)$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$doctors.bannerhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
