values ($lx$rong-bai-md-phoenix$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Rong Bai, MD (Banner Health)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking cardiac electrophysiologist at the Banner - University Medicine Heart Institute in Phoenix, accepting new patients.$lx$, $lx$鳳凰城 Banner - University Medicine 心臟中心會說國語的心臟電生理專科醫師，目前接受新病患。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Rong Bai is a cardiologist specializing in cardiac electrophysiology (heart rhythm disorders) at the Banner - University Medicine Heart Institute, 755 E McDowell Rd, Floor 4, in Phoenix. Dr. Bai sees adults and seniors and is accepting new patients. Dr. Bai earned a medical degree at Tongji Medical College of Huazhong University of Science and Technology, trained there and completed a fellowship at the University of Arizona College of Medicine-Phoenix. Dr. Bai speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed in Banner Health's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Rong Bai 醫師是心臟內科醫師，專長心臟電生理（心律不整），在鳳凰城 755 E McDowell Rd 四樓的 Banner - University Medicine Heart Institute 看診。看診對象為成人及長者，目前接受新病患。Bai 醫師畢業於華中科技大學同濟醫學院並在該院接受訓練，之後在亞利桑那大學鳳凰城醫學院完成專科研修。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據 Banner Health「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$755 E McDowell Rd, Floor 4, Phoenix, AZ 85006$lx$, null, $lx$(602) 521-3090$lx$, null, $lx$https://doctors.bannerhealth.com/provider/rong-bai/3155057$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Rong Bai, MD (Banner Health)$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$doctors.bannerhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
